Drunkless.

00:05:02.093 --> 00:05:04.817
He's doing PE, he was doing calisthenics.

00:05:04.817 --> 00:05:05.650
Oh wow.

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:06.641
In his bedroom.

00:05:06.641 --> 00:05:07.474
I was like, "Okay."

00:05:07.474 --> 00:05:08.307
With the camera on?

00:05:08.307 --> 00:05:12.640
Yeah, he was falling along
with the Instructional thing.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:13.473
That's tough.

00:05:13.473 --> 00:05:15.221
But the thing I realized was,

00:05:15.221 --> 00:05:19.471
well, we've been conducting
so much of our business

00:05:20.497 --> 00:05:24.682
and teamwork and coordination and meetings

00:05:24.682 --> 00:05:27.531
