months and months now.

00:05:27.531 --> 00:05:31.847
But that's totally different
than being in a class.

00:05:31.847 --> 00:05:35.180
But we did get a taste of it whenever...

00:05:37.025 --> 00:05:40.001
As a company, we're doing a class,

00:05:40.001 --> 00:05:42.075
I don't wanna get into
the specifics of it,

00:05:42.075 --> 00:05:46.426
