in a totally different mode,

00:05:46.426 --> 00:05:51.051
than how we conduct our
business meetings over Zoom.

00:05:51.051 --> 00:05:55.473
We're all attending
these enrichment classes.

00:05:55.473 --> 00:05:56.930
So we're all basically students

00:05:56.930 --> 00:06:01.069
