00:06:08.712 --> 00:06:12.879
And something happened
there that I observed that,

00:06:14.154 --> 00:06:14.987
I don't know.

00:06:14.987 --> 00:06:16.436
It just disturbed me a little bit.

00:06:16.436 --> 00:06:19.534
On Reddit, there's a thread called

00:06:19.534 --> 00:06:20.745
Am I The Asshole?

00:06:20.745 --> 00:06:23.340
Where somebody posts
something that happens to them

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:25.561
and how they contributed to a situation.

00:06:25.561 --> 00:06:28.379
And the question up for debate is,

00:06:28.379 --> 00:06:29.923
was I the asshole in this situation?

00:06:29.923 --> 00:06:31.209
And the best ones are the ones

00:06:31.209 --> 00:06:34.126
where the title seems to spell out,

00:06:35.086 --> 00:06:36.897
what I did makes me an asshole.

00:06:36.897 --> 00:06:38.465
But then when they describe it,

00:06:38.465 --> 00:06:42.177
the really good ones change
your mind because the details.

00:06:42.177 --> 00:06:43.928
My question to you is--

00:06:43.928 --> 00:06:45.420
Yeah, you're the asshole.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.507
Am I--

00:06:46.507 --> 00:06:49.207
No, it's a slightly different question.

00:06:49.207 --> 00:06:50.790
It's, am I a creep?

00:06:52.949 --> 00:06:53.782
Okay.

00:06:53.782 --> 00:06:55.265
Here's what happened.

00:06:55.265 --> 00:06:57.029
We were in one of these...

00:06:57.029 --> 00:06:57.879
You were in it too.

00:06:57.879 --> 00:07:01.296
We were both in this class of sorts and--

00:07:03.277 --> 00:07:05.332
I know where you're going
with this by the way,

00:07:05.332 --> 00:07:06.816
but I'm not gonna say anything.

00:07:06.816 --> 00:07:08.473
Okay, you got to tell me.

00:07:08.473 --> 00:07:09.686
Okay. All right.

00:07:09.686 --> 00:07:12.227
Here's what happened.

00:07:12.227 --> 00:07:15.094
I debated whether to talk about this

00:07:15.094 --> 00:07:17.379
because it was very...

00:07:17.379 --> 00:07:18.660
I wanted it to be clear up top

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.045
and I hopefully I've made it clear

00:07:20.045 --> 00:07:21.897
if any of our employees are listening,

00:07:21.897 --> 00:07:26.394
that this is a different
venue and I haven't done this

00:07:26.394 --> 00:07:28.637
with anybody that--

00:07:28.637 --> 00:07:29.521
I know what you're going to say.

00:07:29.521 --> 00:07:31.681
That works for me.
And yes, I have done it.

00:07:31.681 --> 00:07:33.732
Okay, so I'm looking at the screen

00:07:33.732 --> 00:07:35.977
and it's a class, your mind,

00:07:35.977 --> 00:07:37.722
I'm paying attention,

00:07:37.722 --> 00:07:39.350
but it's just somebody talking.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.586
And they'll usually put
a presentation slide up.

00:07:42.586 --> 00:07:45.356
And the thing with a slide
is you can read everything

00:07:45.356 --> 00:07:46.664
on the slide like that

00:07:46.664 --> 00:07:48.757
but they've only read through half of it.

00:07:48.757 --> 00:07:50.812
So I'm like, "Okay, I
know where this is going.

00:07:50.812 --> 00:07:52.452
I've read the second half of the slide.

00:07:52.452 --> 00:07:53.664
So what am I gonna do now?

00:07:53.664 --> 00:07:55.996
I'm gonna look around at the other people

00:07:55.996 --> 00:07:57.980
