00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:01.205
And I noticed that one
person who was sending...

00:08:01.205 --> 00:08:02.531
With the webcam on,

00:08:02.531 --> 00:08:05.396
we basically all had our webcams on,

00:08:05.396 --> 00:08:07.337
by the way, for my kids, they're required

00:08:07.337 --> 00:08:09.420
