that you're paying attention.

00:08:13.271 --> 00:08:14.104
Of course.

00:08:14.104 --> 00:08:15.275
Which makes sense.

00:08:15.275 --> 00:08:16.108
Looks like you just like put

00:08:16.108 --> 00:08:18.762
