00:08:21.562 --> 00:08:23.599
Has one of your kids
got in trouble for that?

00:08:23.599 --> 00:08:25.789
You had to say it was your idea.

00:08:25.789 --> 00:08:27.408
Yeah. It was a tarp.

00:08:27.408 --> 00:08:29.433
A privacy tarp.

00:08:29.433 --> 00:08:33.558
I noticed this one
person in the background,

00:08:33.558 --> 00:08:34.896
they're sitting in the foreground,

00:08:34.896 --> 00:08:36.284
right in front of their webcam,

00:08:36.284 --> 00:08:38.928
