this person's shoulder,

00:08:38.928 --> 00:08:43.261
I see one of the far walls
is decorated with albums.

00:08:44.695 --> 00:08:47.891
I'm like, "Oh, I did that
in our creative house."

00:08:47.891 --> 00:08:49.783
Okay, this is going in
a different direction.

00:08:49.783 --> 00:08:51.348
Oh, it is.

00:08:51.348 --> 00:08:54.570
So then I went over and
I pinned this person

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:56.671
