00:09:04.754 --> 00:09:06.623
To me that's not pertinent--

00:09:06.623 --> 00:09:08.698
But you did mention it.

00:09:08.698 --> 00:09:09.896
And I'm looking--
As if it might be.

00:09:09.896 --> 00:09:13.729
I'm looking over her
shoulder at her albums.

00:09:16.017 --> 00:09:17.558
And I'm leaning in,

00:09:17.558 --> 00:09:19.198
