00:10:02.472 --> 00:10:04.166
And there she is.

00:10:04.166 --> 00:10:07.999
And I'm like, "Oh my
gosh, this feels creepy."

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:12.337
Meaning I'm starting to feel like creep.

00:10:12.337 --> 00:10:13.837
And like unpender.

00:10:14.842 --> 00:10:19.718
And I was like, "Oh my gosh,
what have I done? Who am I?

00:10:19.718 --> 00:10:23.885
Because it felt weird that
I was like scrutinizing

00:10:24.909 --> 00:10:26.487
