00:10:33.082 --> 00:10:34.581
That's what I do.

00:10:36.548 --> 00:10:39.036
You please take the hid off
me and tell me about it.

00:10:39.036 --> 00:10:41.060
I knew this is what you were gonna say.

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:44.516
It went a slightly different direction.

00:10:44.516 --> 00:10:47.917
And it's interesting that
you found this ability,

00:10:47.917 --> 00:10:49.098
it seems more recently.

00:10:49.098 --> 00:10:51.119
Well, I know you can pin people but--

00:10:51.119 --> 00:10:51.952
No, no you--

00:10:51.952 --> 00:10:53.406
Pin people who aren't talking?

00:10:53.406 --> 00:10:54.239
You began to--

00:10:54.239 --> 00:10:55.698
And don't know you're looking at them.

00:10:55.698 --> 00:10:57.767
