related to the parasite

00:50:03.583 --> 00:50:05.198
that causes malaria.

00:50:05.198 --> 00:50:10.198
Cats get T gondii and the disease
it causes is toxoplasmosis

00:50:10.314 --> 00:50:13.115
by eating infected rodents,
birds and other animals.

00:50:13.115 --> 00:50:15.201
Estimate suggested about 40% of cats

00:50:15.201 --> 00:50:16.644
