00:50:31.649 --> 00:50:34.842
This particular organism evolved.

00:50:34.842 --> 00:50:39.789
It only can reproduce in the
digestive tract of a cat.

00:50:39.789 --> 00:50:42.849
That's the only place that
it can actually undergo

00:50:42.849 --> 00:50:44.550
its reproduction process.

00:50:44.550 --> 00:50:46.782
So it's got to get into the poop of cats.

00:50:46.782 --> 00:50:49.615
And then it's got to get back into

00:50:50.456 --> 00:50:51.903
a cat's digestive system.

00:50:51.903 --> 00:50:54.961
So what it has developed is an adaptation

00:50:54.961 --> 00:50:59.001
whereby when it gets
into a rat or a mouse,

00:50:59.001 --> 00:51:03.001
cysts grow on the neurons,
inside the mice brain

00:51:04.628 --> 00:51:08.961
and causes the rodent to
lose it's fear of cat piss.

00:51:11.764 --> 00:51:13.264
So mice and rats--

00:51:14.140 --> 00:51:15.055
