00:51:15.055 --> 00:51:17.041
They're repelled by cat piss.

00:51:17.041 --> 00:51:19.356
And if they get toxoplasmosis,

00:51:19.356 --> 00:51:21.868
not only are they not repelled by it,

00:51:21.868 --> 00:51:24.159
but some studies suggest
that they're into it,

00:51:24.159 --> 00:51:25.670
that they're attracted to it.

00:51:25.670 --> 00:51:26.662
And as you can imagine--

00:51:26.662 --> 00:51:28.346
So the cat opens it's mouth,

00:51:28.346 --> 00:51:30.105
well it's pee hole and it walked right in.

00:51:30.105 --> 00:51:32.231
So they lose their fear
of cats, essentially,

00:51:32.231 --> 00:51:33.785
which makes them an easy target,

00:51:33.785 --> 00:51:35.897
which gets the toxoplasmosis or gets

00:51:35.897 --> 00:51:38.812
the T gondii back into the
digestive tract of the cat

00:51:38.812 --> 00:51:41.563
and the process starts all over again.

00:51:41.563 --> 00:51:42.396
Now--

00:51:42.396 --> 00:51:45.306
